WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:35.400
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.560
=Ren Yu=

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.000
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.960
=Episode 16=

00:01:57.319 --> 00:01:57.760
Dongchen.

00:01:57.879 --> 00:01:58.840
Any word on Na?

00:01:59.120 --> 00:01:59.560
No.

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:01.359
Maybe there was something

00:02:01.439 --> 00:02:02.519
she wanted something there,

00:02:02.519 --> 00:02:03.200
so she went back?

00:02:04.359 --> 00:02:05.000
Maybe.

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.560
We fought about it before.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:07.920
Right.

00:02:08.759 --> 00:02:10.240
When did you say it went missing?

00:02:11.759 --> 00:02:12.719
A few days ago.

00:02:13.159 --> 00:02:14.240
Probably hauled away.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:15.879
Maybe Ma Na

00:02:15.919 --> 00:02:17.080
went to a scrapyard nearby?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:18.479
Right.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:19.800
Could be.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:21.599
I'll go now.

00:02:21.919 --> 00:02:22.879
Don't panic.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:23.639
Mr. Ma.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:25.319
You check north. We'll check south.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:25.840
Split up.

00:02:26.199 --> 00:02:26.680
Okay.

00:02:26.759 --> 00:02:27.919
Thanks.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:28.759
Let's go.

00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:29.680
- Go.
- Bye, Mei.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:38.160
(Shengliang Recycling Center)

00:02:39.639 --> 00:02:40.080
Hi.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.120
Seen someone this tall,

00:02:42.199 --> 00:02:43.199
about my age?

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:43.879
No.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:45.599
Hi.

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:46.319
Excuse me.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.280
Have you seen

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.680
a girl around 17 or 18?

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:49.680
A student?

00:02:51.159 --> 00:02:52.240
No.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.199
Hi.

00:02:55.919 --> 00:02:57.360
Have you seen a girl

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.360
(Chaobei Vocational High School)
my age?

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.479
About this tall?

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:04.200
(Chaobei Vocational High School
Training Department)

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:06.960
Sir.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.400
Seen a girl

00:03:08.479 --> 00:03:09.719
around 17 or 18?

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.000
Long hair, looks like a student.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:12.800
No.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:13.639
Stay back.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:14.639
You're in my way.

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:15.479
Okay. Thanks.

00:03:28.759 --> 00:03:29.919
Doesn't smell good.

00:03:40.879 --> 00:03:41.439
Mr. Zhou.

00:03:44.159 --> 00:03:45.319
Let's look around town.

00:04:05.039 --> 00:04:05.680
Mr. Zhou.

00:04:06.719 --> 00:04:09.000
If Ma Na isn't at a scrapyard,

00:04:09.879 --> 00:04:12.360
could she be at a bus or train station?

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:13.919
Open that case.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.400
A phone's inside.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.480
Call Ms. Wang.

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:19.160
Have her ask

00:04:19.519 --> 00:04:20.360
is Jiang Ting home?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:29.959
Ma Na!

00:04:35.959 --> 00:04:36.519
Ma Na!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.399
Ma Na!

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:38.959
Ma Na!

00:04:58.759 --> 00:04:59.240
Ma Na!

00:04:59.319 --> 00:04:59.759
Yang Le!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:03.879
Ma Na!

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.240
Come here.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:06.480
Ma Na.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.720
Come here. It's dangerous.

00:05:09.279 --> 00:05:10.360
We can talk this out.

00:05:10.759 --> 00:05:12.120
It feels so good up here.

00:05:13.759 --> 00:05:14.720
It feels

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.639
like I could fly.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.519
Ma Na.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:24.720
Call Ms. Wang.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.240
Tell Ma Na's parents

00:05:26.319 --> 00:05:27.759
we found her. Go!

00:05:27.879 --> 00:05:28.279
Okay.

00:05:31.519 --> 00:05:31.959
Ma Na.

00:05:32.639 --> 00:05:33.800
It's windy and dangerous.

00:05:33.839 --> 00:05:34.759
Please come over here.

00:05:34.959 --> 00:05:36.160
Listen to me. Come here.

00:05:38.759 --> 00:05:39.519
Mr. Zhou.

00:05:40.079 --> 00:05:41.680
Don't you only care

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:42.920
about that contest?

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:44.920
I'm not kidding.

00:05:45.399 --> 00:05:46.240
Kidding?

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.959
You think I'm playing?

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:50.000
You adults are all the same.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.279
It's your fault,

00:05:51.319 --> 00:05:52.639
but you blame me.

00:05:53.079 --> 00:05:53.639
Trust me.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:54.560
I won't.

00:05:55.079 --> 00:05:56.560
I'm trying to help you.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:57.879
Help me?

00:05:58.519 --> 00:06:00.000
Since when do you care?

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.800
Even if I jumped,

00:06:01.959 --> 00:06:02.879
all you'd say is,

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.480
"Now we need a new Little Mermaid

00:06:04.519 --> 00:06:05.279
read that trash."

00:06:05.319 --> 00:06:06.040
No, I wouldn't.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:06.879
I promise.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:08.120
Ma Na.

00:06:08.879 --> 00:06:10.240
Anger's clouding your head.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.639
It's taken over your heart.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.519
Listen to me. Come here.

00:06:16.839 --> 00:06:17.879
Enough, Mr. Zhou.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.800
You think you sound so sophisticated?

00:06:25.639 --> 00:06:26.480
Some poet.

00:06:29.199 --> 00:06:30.519
I don't get it.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.000
You've got a wife.

00:06:32.199 --> 00:06:33.720
You work at the Cultural Center.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.680
Just keep living off your wife.

00:06:39.279 --> 00:06:41.680
Why write your stupid poems?

00:06:42.079 --> 00:06:43.439
Who are you trying to impress?

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:52.319
Don't come closer.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:15.519
What are you doing?

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.079
The view is different

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.399
from up high.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:37.560
Ma Na.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.279
Know what happens

00:07:40.639 --> 00:07:41.439
if you fall now?

00:07:46.519 --> 00:07:47.519
Your center of gravity

00:07:48.079 --> 00:07:49.639
is in front of your sacrum.

00:07:50.639 --> 00:07:52.639
In a free fall,

00:07:53.279 --> 00:07:55.360
you're likely to land headfirst.

00:07:59.439 --> 00:08:00.439
You'd crack your head.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.000
Brains splattered everywhere.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.399
And that's the lucky outcome.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:07.639
If you're unlucky,

00:08:08.439 --> 00:08:09.480
you land on your feet.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:11.279
Your whole body

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:12.839
shattered.

00:08:13.959 --> 00:08:15.720
More precisely, you'd be paralyzed.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:17.600
From then on,

00:08:18.199 --> 00:08:20.360
you'd need help with everything.

00:08:21.519 --> 00:08:22.160
Bathroom,

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.160
eating, getting dressed.

00:08:26.839 --> 00:08:27.720
You'd be disabled,

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.360
trapped in a miserable life.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.559
And that's still not the worst.

00:08:40.039 --> 00:08:40.879
The worst

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:42.960
is landing on your backside.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.159
Compression fractures everywhere.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.240
Stop.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:49.200
Your upper body would compress-

00:08:49.279 --> 00:08:50.759
Shut up! I said stop!

00:09:05.879 --> 00:09:06.840
No, Na!

00:09:07.679 --> 00:09:08.240
Na!

00:09:08.399 --> 00:09:09.279
Don't do this!

00:09:09.399 --> 00:09:10.240
You hear me?

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.559
I need to talk to you.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.720
Please listen to me.

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:18.360
Dongchen.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.679
- Sir.
- Dongchen.

00:09:22.279 --> 00:09:22.799
You okay?

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:23.519
You okay?

00:09:28.639 --> 00:09:29.240
Na!

00:09:30.559 --> 00:09:31.159
Na!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:32.720
Na!

00:09:33.759 --> 00:09:34.320
Stay back!

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:37.120
I was wrong this time.

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:38.639
Please forgive me.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:40.440
I'll do anything.

00:09:40.679 --> 00:09:42.279
Just don't hurt yourself.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:43.600
Come down.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.320
Stay back!

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:45.519
I will. I will.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:47.320
Sending me abroad,

00:09:47.519 --> 00:09:48.919
you threw my stuff away.

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:49.919
Na.

00:09:50.639 --> 00:09:52.480
Hold onto the railing.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.919
Listen to me.

00:09:54.919 --> 00:09:56.879
I know I rented out the old house

00:09:57.039 --> 00:09:58.120
without telling you.

00:09:58.879 --> 00:10:00.240
And I threw your things away.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:00.799
Call cops.

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:01.600
Get behind her.

00:10:01.639 --> 00:10:03.679
Whatever I tossed, I'll get it back.

00:10:03.919 --> 00:10:04.639
If I can't,

00:10:04.879 --> 00:10:06.240
I'll buy you another.

00:10:06.639 --> 00:10:07.159
Okay?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.279
You threw away

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.960
the towel bunny Mom gave me.

00:10:11.279 --> 00:10:13.200
Can you get that back?

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:19.879
I really

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:20.840
didn't know.

00:10:21.799 --> 00:10:23.559
But I rented the house out

00:10:23.639 --> 00:10:24.480
for your sake.

00:10:24.519 --> 00:10:25.360
For my own good?

00:10:25.799 --> 00:10:26.240
Yes.

00:10:28.159 --> 00:10:29.559
There it is again.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.039
For my own good.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.399
You always say that.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.639
But you never care

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:36.200
what I think.

00:10:36.919 --> 00:10:37.960
Every time

00:10:38.519 --> 00:10:39.720
you don't want me around,

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.600
you dump me on someone else.

00:10:41.799 --> 00:10:43.360
Now you can't control me,

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:45.120
so you're sending me abroad.

00:10:45.559 --> 00:10:47.360
You just want me gone for good.

00:10:47.399 --> 00:10:49.720
You only care about yourself.

00:10:50.639 --> 00:10:52.320
Ma Dongchen, listen.

00:10:52.679 --> 00:10:54.240
I'll never trust you again.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.519
And I'm never going home.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.399
I'm jumping.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:10:58.879
Na, don't!

00:10:58.879 --> 00:10:59.879
You'll regret it forever!

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:00.679
Na!

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:02.759
Stay back!

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:04.399
Ma Na!

00:11:04.879 --> 00:11:05.440
Ma Na!

00:11:10.679 --> 00:11:11.440
That was close.

00:11:14.639 --> 00:11:15.320
Come here.

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:28.760
Yeah.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.600
Where does he live now?

00:11:33.039 --> 00:11:33.399
Okay.

00:11:33.799 --> 00:11:35.000
We'll verify it right away.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:36.080
Then we'll call you.

00:11:36.759 --> 00:11:37.200
Thanks.

00:11:37.759 --> 00:11:38.120
Captain.

00:11:38.879 --> 00:11:40.120
How'd it go at Institute No. 2?

00:11:40.399 --> 00:11:41.039
Smooth.

00:11:41.399 --> 00:11:42.440
This case is top priority.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.039
Put us first in line.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:44.960
Nice.

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.440
Long trip, huh?

00:11:47.559 --> 00:11:48.720
Take a look at this list.

00:11:49.399 --> 00:11:50.919
Xiaobei Street Police Station called.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.559
One name on their list,

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:54.080
Tang Leping,

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:55.039
moved out.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:55.919
Rented it out.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.360
He lives well outside the buffer zone.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.279
So I think we can clear him.

00:12:00.799 --> 00:12:02.279
Then check the tenant too.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:03.480
Tenant's Zhou Xijie.

00:12:03.559 --> 00:12:05.240
What we know so far,

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:06.879
(Zhou Xijie)
male, 35.

00:12:06.919 --> 00:12:08.360
Seems he works at Cultural Center.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:09.720
I'll check the vehicle registry.

00:12:09.799 --> 00:12:10.759
If he fits,

00:12:11.159 --> 00:12:12.240
bring him in for blood.

00:12:37.519 --> 00:12:38.200
Easy.

00:12:42.559 --> 00:12:43.200
You okay?

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:44.519
I'm fine.

00:12:45.879 --> 00:12:47.399
I know Golden Bell Shield

00:12:48.639 --> 00:12:49.440
and Iron Shirt.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:52.200
Don't worry.

00:12:52.919 --> 00:12:55.080
We'll follow the fishing line back.

00:12:55.399 --> 00:12:58.720
Lots of manholes have ladders.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.200
We'll find one.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.960
I'll pop the cover open.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:04.480
Mm-hm.

00:13:06.559 --> 00:13:07.000
Let's go.

00:13:07.799 --> 00:13:08.279
Okay.

00:13:11.799 --> 00:13:13.039
You okay, Mr. Gu?

00:13:13.399 --> 00:13:14.039
You okay?

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:14.559
I'm fine.

00:13:14.759 --> 00:13:15.600
You okay?

00:13:16.919 --> 00:13:17.519
Easy.

00:13:17.639 --> 00:13:18.120
I'm fine.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.080
Ting!

00:13:26.799 --> 00:13:27.799
Ting!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:28.919
Mom!

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.200
Mom, I'm here!

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:42.240
Jiang.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:43.840
Jiang.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:45.679
Mom.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.120
Weren't you at work?

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:51.000
Work?

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:52.399
How could I?

00:13:52.919 --> 00:13:54.960
Your school called my office.

00:13:55.759 --> 00:13:56.240
Jiang.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:57.799
Don't be mad.

00:13:58.720 --> 00:13:59.279
My fault.

00:13:59.679 --> 00:14:00.639
Of course it is!

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.840
Who else's?

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:02.120
Mom.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.519
This isn't Mr. Gu's fault.

00:14:03.679 --> 00:14:04.720
She's just a kid.

00:14:04.879 --> 00:14:06.639
You took her somewhere this dangerous?

00:14:06.759 --> 00:14:07.879
You're a grown man.

00:14:08.159 --> 00:14:09.039
I'm so sorry.

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:11.440
Go home.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:14.720
Jiang Ting.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.399
Give your mom her bag.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:18.879
From now on,

00:14:19.519 --> 00:14:20.840
we're staying out of this.

00:14:25.559 --> 00:14:26.440
Go home.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.120
(Info Desk)
ID?

00:14:43.679 --> 00:14:44.399
Young lady.

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:46.159
Without ID or registration,

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.240
you can't take the entrance exam.

00:14:49.919 --> 00:14:51.039
If you lost your documents,

00:14:52.039 --> 00:14:53.039
get replacements now.

00:14:55.679 --> 00:14:56.320
Su Lin.

00:14:56.799 --> 00:14:58.519
You said you're Su Lin?

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.080
Yes.

00:15:00.039 --> 00:15:01.960
But the records show

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.320
(Canceled)
Su Lin's registration was canceled.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:08.480
Why was it canceled?

00:15:09.159 --> 00:15:11.960
Your family filed a death certificate.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.720
(Resident Registration Form: Su Lin)

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:30.080
(Household Registration Division)

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:31.120
Miss.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:48.080
Mom, are you still mad?

00:16:02.679 --> 00:16:04.240
Do you know

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:06.879
how dangerous it was?

00:16:07.759 --> 00:16:09.720
That's exactly why

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.519
I couldn't give up.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.080
Mom, do you know

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.600
what those sewers are like?

00:16:18.919 --> 00:16:21.399
Beyond the flashlight beam,

00:16:22.679 --> 00:16:24.360
you can't see anything.

00:16:25.639 --> 00:16:26.519
Pitch black.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:28.919
Dirty and stinking.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.559
Rats everywhere.

00:16:33.759 --> 00:16:35.559
When Mr. Gu went up to the cover,

00:16:36.799 --> 00:16:38.320
I was terrified down there.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.519
It was so dark,

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.759
with all these scary noises.

00:16:44.919 --> 00:16:46.240
I thought I'd die of fear.

00:16:47.919 --> 00:16:49.440
Mr. Gu kept calming me down,

00:16:50.639 --> 00:16:51.440
I heard nothing.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.679
Nothing got through.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.120
I just wanted out.

00:16:58.279 --> 00:17:00.360
I thought I'd never see you again.

00:17:02.879 --> 00:17:04.279
Then you came.

00:17:05.319 --> 00:17:07.200
When I saw you lift that cover,

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.920
I was so happy.

00:17:14.799 --> 00:17:15.319
Mom.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.000
I'm so lucky to have you.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.279
Then I think about Su Lin.

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:29.400
Her parents abandoned her.

00:17:30.839 --> 00:17:32.519
She's been down there so long.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.200
She must be terrified.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.480
All alone.

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:39.960
It's filthy down there.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:42.119
Not even clean water.

00:17:42.359 --> 00:17:43.480
Let alone food.

00:17:45.039 --> 00:17:47.160
Could she still be alive?

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:59.119
Only Mr. Gu and I are looking now.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:03.160
If I stop,

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.839
no one will look for Su Lin.

00:18:10.359 --> 00:18:11.799
Sneaking down there was wrong.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.640
I know that.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.039
But no matter what,

00:18:19.039 --> 00:18:20.920
I'm going to find Su Lin.

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:25.480
Or I'll regret it forever.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:38.599
Ting.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.319
If you trust me,

00:18:46.799 --> 00:18:48.279
leave it

00:18:51.799 --> 00:18:52.720
to me.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:18:59.680
Okay?

00:19:24.039 --> 00:19:24.680
Gu.

00:19:26.319 --> 00:19:27.319
What are you doing here?

00:19:28.039 --> 00:19:29.519
Dropped a file off at the province.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:30.599
Came for a shower.

00:19:30.759 --> 00:19:31.400
Leaving soon.

00:19:37.079 --> 00:19:37.880
Where were you?

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.160
I went into the sewer.

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.000
Didn't I tell you not to?

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.119
Why won't you listen?

00:19:45.519 --> 00:19:47.119
Police are on it. Why go down?

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.240
I was worried.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:49.960
So you act reckless?

00:19:50.119 --> 00:19:51.519
Quit yelling at me.

00:19:52.359 --> 00:19:53.519
I need to tell you something.

00:19:59.359 --> 00:20:00.519
When I went down,

00:20:02.119 --> 00:20:03.599
someone shut the manhole.

00:20:03.799 --> 00:20:04.759
Then how'd you get out?

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.240
Doesn't matter.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.480
Whoever did it meant to.

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:11.079
They shut the manhole

00:20:11.599 --> 00:20:13.599
and piled bricks on top.

00:20:14.279 --> 00:20:15.759
When I got out,

00:20:16.799 --> 00:20:18.559
there were footprints by the cover.

00:20:19.599 --> 00:20:20.799
They weren't mine.

00:20:21.359 --> 00:20:22.440
Dress-shoe prints.

00:20:23.519 --> 00:20:24.920
That's attempted murder.

00:20:25.039 --> 00:20:25.759
We need to check.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:26.599
Who was it?

00:20:27.039 --> 00:20:28.119
How would I know?

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:35.839
Find anything else?

00:20:36.279 --> 00:20:36.920
Like

00:20:37.039 --> 00:20:38.440
bike parts being swapped?

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:39.359
No.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:40.880
But I found something

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.160
at a place

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.799
like a reservoir.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.319
A wool coat.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:50.480
My slippers.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.240
A wool coat?

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:55.680
A woman's.

00:20:56.319 --> 00:20:58.079
Definitely not Su Lin's.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:20:59.960
What color?

00:21:01.599 --> 00:21:02.279
Purple.

00:21:12.599 --> 00:21:13.160
Gu.

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:16.839
What?

00:21:17.119 --> 00:21:18.440
We gotta get to the bureau.

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:27.680
(West Chaobei Recycling Center)

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:52.079
Vincent.

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:57.000
(West Chaobei Recycling Center)

00:22:12.039 --> 00:22:12.799
What's this?

00:22:14.119 --> 00:22:14.759
Ther-

00:22:15.519 --> 00:22:16.920
mos.

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:50.720
I can't take the entrance exam.

00:22:55.359 --> 00:22:56.720
I don't have an ID.

00:22:57.599 --> 00:22:58.640
Or household registration.

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:03.960
In this world,

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:07.799
I don't exist anymore.

00:23:27.039 --> 00:23:27.400
Go.

00:23:28.039 --> 00:23:28.400
Go.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:29.039
Go.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:36.039
Go, go, go.

00:23:36.519 --> 00:23:37.440
Where are we going?

00:23:37.799 --> 00:23:38.200
Go.

00:23:39.120 --> 00:23:41.600
(West Chaobei Recycling Center)

00:23:51.359 --> 00:23:51.920
Coming.

00:23:55.839 --> 00:23:56.279
Go.

00:23:56.920 --> 00:23:57.440
Go.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:02.720
I'll take it.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:03.799
I'll wait in car.

00:24:03.799 --> 00:24:04.359
Okay.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:06.160
Hello?

00:24:07.119 --> 00:24:07.839
Mr. Gu.

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:10.279
It's Jiang Ting's mom.

00:24:10.839 --> 00:24:11.799
Hi, Jiang.

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:13.279
I'm sorry.

00:24:14.119 --> 00:24:16.960
I really lost my temper today.

00:24:17.160 --> 00:24:18.119
No, Jiang.

00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:19.720
I didn't think it through.

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:21.240
Jiang,

00:24:21.920 --> 00:24:22.839
I have to go.

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:25.039
I'm rushing to the police bureau.

00:24:25.799 --> 00:24:26.559
Go ahead.

00:24:26.799 --> 00:24:27.759
Okay. Bye.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:35.720
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:36.519
Stop. Stop.

00:24:37.960 --> 00:24:38.559
Jiang.

00:24:43.599 --> 00:24:44.599
What are you doing here?

00:24:45.680 --> 00:24:47.759
Ting told me everything.

00:24:49.319 --> 00:24:50.680
I'm going to help her find Su Lin.

00:24:52.839 --> 00:24:53.279
Gu.

00:24:54.160 --> 00:24:55.160
This is...

00:24:56.680 --> 00:24:57.640
That coat

00:24:58.480 --> 00:24:59.599
we found in the sewer.

00:24:59.720 --> 00:25:01.359
Her daughter and I found it together.

00:25:04.000 --> 00:25:05.640
I can't be sure of the style,

00:25:06.319 --> 00:25:08.079
but I remember the color

00:25:08.319 --> 00:25:08.960
and fur collar.

00:25:09.319 --> 00:25:10.039
I'm pretty sure.

00:25:16.640 --> 00:25:17.279
Get a team.

00:25:17.920 --> 00:25:18.920
Call Zhong Cheng, Li Hui.

00:25:19.039 --> 00:25:19.920
Get them here now.

00:25:21.160 --> 00:25:22.640
Chaobei's underground utility system

00:25:22.799 --> 00:25:24.839
was built during World War II.

00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:26.799
It differs a little

00:25:27.079 --> 00:25:27.920
from today's rules.

00:25:28.839 --> 00:25:29.440
Gu.

00:25:29.920 --> 00:25:30.359
Yes?

00:25:31.079 --> 00:25:33.160
(Utility Map)
Try to remember

00:25:33.359 --> 00:25:35.599
exactly where you found the coat.

00:25:35.920 --> 00:25:36.319
Yes.

00:25:41.759 --> 00:25:42.960
You said

00:25:43.400 --> 00:25:45.720
you went down through that manhole

00:25:45.920 --> 00:25:47.480
by the towel factory housing complex.

00:25:47.720 --> 00:25:48.160
Right.

00:25:52.680 --> 00:25:53.759
After that, I don't remember

00:25:54.079 --> 00:25:56.400
if I turned left or right.

00:25:57.680 --> 00:25:58.720
(Utility Map)
But I know

00:25:58.759 --> 00:25:59.720
I didn't go far.

00:26:00.559 --> 00:26:01.400
Then I reached

00:26:01.559 --> 00:26:03.319
a place like a reservoir.

00:26:03.640 --> 00:26:05.759
That's where I found the coat.

00:26:06.160 --> 00:26:07.119
A reservoir.

00:26:08.480 --> 00:26:10.400
Near this line,

00:26:11.279 --> 00:26:12.759
(Utility Map)
just one reservoir.

00:26:16.920 --> 00:26:17.359
Here.

00:26:18.319 --> 00:26:19.079
City Museum.

00:26:20.680 --> 00:26:21.240
Area B.

00:26:26.400 --> 00:26:26.880
Li Hui.

00:26:26.960 --> 00:26:27.400
Yes.

00:26:27.559 --> 00:26:28.720
Request sewer-entry gear.

00:26:29.119 --> 00:26:29.599
Zhong Cheng.

00:26:29.839 --> 00:26:30.359
Yes.

00:26:30.480 --> 00:26:31.519
Call the Planning Bureau.

00:26:31.839 --> 00:26:33.279
Have them assist the recovery.

00:26:33.920 --> 00:26:34.359
Tai Wei.

00:26:35.200 --> 00:26:35.880
Get medical examiner.

00:26:36.559 --> 00:26:37.799
There may be another victim.

00:26:38.279 --> 00:26:38.680
Go.

00:26:39.079 --> 00:26:39.640
Yes.

00:26:42.079 --> 00:26:43.119
Thanks for your help, Gu.

00:26:43.519 --> 00:26:43.920
Sure.

00:26:44.200 --> 00:26:44.599
Thanks.

00:26:47.599 --> 00:26:48.279
Gu.

00:26:49.759 --> 00:26:51.160
You're an important eyewitness.

00:26:52.119 --> 00:26:54.359
We need you to go back down

00:26:54.759 --> 00:26:57.519
and confirm where the coat was.

00:26:57.640 --> 00:26:58.160
No problem.

00:27:00.960 --> 00:27:01.400
Hi.

00:27:02.680 --> 00:27:03.839
Blood draws here?

00:27:04.000 --> 00:27:04.599
I don't know.

00:27:04.720 --> 00:27:05.400
They do.

00:27:07.160 --> 00:27:08.079
I'm Zhou Xijie.

00:27:08.359 --> 00:27:10.480
The station sent me for a blood draw.

00:27:11.119 --> 00:27:11.759
Come with me.

00:27:13.640 --> 00:27:14.680
Here's my blood draw form.

00:27:18.279 --> 00:27:18.880
Outside.

00:27:19.079 --> 00:27:19.480
Okay.

00:27:21.000 --> 00:27:23.000
What's this about the wool coat?

00:27:23.319 --> 00:27:24.799
You heard about the body

00:27:25.119 --> 00:27:26.920
from the Weihong Canal?

00:27:27.400 --> 00:27:28.240
Now they think

00:27:28.799 --> 00:27:30.839
the coat Ting and I found

00:27:31.000 --> 00:27:32.119
is connected to that case.

00:27:35.680 --> 00:27:38.240
Then Su Lin down there...

00:27:38.279 --> 00:27:39.000
Don't worry.

00:27:39.839 --> 00:27:41.480
The coat isn't Su Lin's.

00:27:42.359 --> 00:27:44.400
But I'm going down with them.

00:27:44.960 --> 00:27:45.839
Go home for now.

00:27:46.000 --> 00:27:46.759
Wait for me.

00:27:48.279 --> 00:27:48.960
No.

00:27:50.759 --> 00:27:53.680
That's why I came.

00:27:55.640 --> 00:27:57.839
I want to help find Su Lin.

00:28:00.200 --> 00:28:01.519
I really don't want

00:28:02.279 --> 00:28:04.519
Ting dragged into this.

00:28:05.279 --> 00:28:07.400
But I'm not selfish either.

00:28:09.599 --> 00:28:11.599
I care about Su Lin.

00:28:12.759 --> 00:28:13.680
Especially

00:28:15.279 --> 00:28:16.480
after going to her home.

00:28:21.000 --> 00:28:21.599
So,

00:28:23.079 --> 00:28:24.680
I'm asking you to let me

00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:27.119
come with you.

00:28:29.759 --> 00:28:31.200
I promised Ting.

00:28:31.759 --> 00:28:33.559
I need to do this for her.

00:28:39.000 --> 00:28:39.920
You and Ting

00:28:42.079 --> 00:28:43.160
are both good people.

00:28:47.599 --> 00:28:48.200
Du.

00:28:48.200 --> 00:28:49.200
Yeah?

00:28:50.599 --> 00:28:51.279
Draw blood.

00:28:52.480 --> 00:28:52.880
Okay.

00:28:53.200 --> 00:28:54.119
Have a seat.

00:28:59.320 --> 00:29:00.820
(Chaobei Police Bureau Forensics Lab
DNA Report)

00:29:00.820 --> 00:29:01.519
(Zhou Xijie, Blood)

00:29:01.519 --> 00:29:02.480
Zhou Xijie?

00:29:03.119 --> 00:29:03.599
Yes.

00:29:05.839 --> 00:29:06.480
This arm.

00:29:08.799 --> 00:29:10.000
(The killer is likely)

00:29:10.640 --> 00:29:12.759
(an ordinary, mild-mannered)

00:29:13.039 --> 00:29:13.839
(man.)

00:29:14.000 --> 00:29:15.559
(He must look)

00:29:16.039 --> 00:29:18.920
(trustworthy.)

00:29:22.279 --> 00:29:26.839
(He's likely 30 to 40 years old.)

00:29:27.519 --> 00:29:29.000
(And probably has)

00:29:29.119 --> 00:29:30.759
(a respectable job.)

00:29:31.000 --> 00:29:32.039
(Male, around 35 or 36.)

00:29:32.119 --> 00:29:33.640
(Works at the Cultural Center.)

00:29:50.680 --> 00:29:54.240
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

00:29:57.560 --> 00:29:59.200
(Chaobei City Museum, Qingjiang)

00:30:01.079 --> 00:30:01.599
(Jiang.)

00:30:01.960 --> 00:30:04.240
(I had Tai Wei request)

00:30:04.240 --> 00:30:05.160
(approval.)

00:30:05.680 --> 00:30:08.160
(You'll go down as)

00:30:08.599 --> 00:30:09.599
(a witness in the case.)

00:30:19.839 --> 00:30:20.640
Don't be nervous.

00:30:21.000 --> 00:30:22.440
Plenty of cops are going down.

00:30:22.680 --> 00:30:23.599
You'll be safe.

00:30:29.359 --> 00:30:29.799
Okay.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:30.720
Don't be nervous.

00:30:32.039 --> 00:30:33.119
We've been here before.

00:30:33.559 --> 00:30:34.799
We checked most of this area.

00:30:35.480 --> 00:30:36.559
Now we're here.

00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:39.359
Three routes lead

00:30:39.839 --> 00:30:40.920
to the reservoir.

00:31:13.240 --> 00:31:14.240
(Appearance Check)

00:31:14.240 --> 00:31:15.880
What do you do for work?

00:31:16.279 --> 00:31:17.319
Missing work for this?

00:31:18.000 --> 00:31:18.599
Not at all.

00:31:19.359 --> 00:31:21.039
I work at the Cultural Center.

00:31:21.519 --> 00:31:22.400
It's been slow lately.

00:31:22.799 --> 00:31:23.480
I've got time.

00:31:25.720 --> 00:31:27.920
No staff housing there?

00:31:28.480 --> 00:31:30.799
My wife and I live with her dad.

00:31:31.799 --> 00:31:33.039
I have

00:31:33.200 --> 00:31:33.839
too much gear.

00:31:34.279 --> 00:31:35.039
Clutters home.

00:31:35.559 --> 00:31:36.440
My wife hates it.

00:31:39.039 --> 00:31:40.039
So, a studio?

00:31:42.279 --> 00:31:42.960
Just storage.

00:31:45.880 --> 00:31:47.240
Thanks for cooperating.

00:31:48.559 --> 00:31:49.079
Of course.

00:31:49.880 --> 00:31:51.039
Thanks, Officer.

00:31:51.799 --> 00:31:52.359
Take care.

00:32:52.200 --> 00:32:52.799
Gu.

00:32:53.440 --> 00:32:53.920
Gu.

00:32:54.759 --> 00:32:55.319
Found it.

00:32:55.839 --> 00:32:56.720
Looks like the place.

00:32:56.720 --> 00:32:57.319
Take a look.

00:32:59.119 --> 00:32:59.599
That's it.

00:33:00.039 --> 00:33:00.279
Good.

00:33:03.839 --> 00:33:04.440
Here?

00:33:04.960 --> 00:33:05.279
Yeah.

00:33:05.839 --> 00:33:06.279
Right here.

00:33:06.480 --> 00:33:07.240
Behind this door.

00:33:07.559 --> 00:33:09.039
I put the coat

00:33:09.039 --> 00:33:09.839
on an iron railing.

00:33:11.319 --> 00:33:12.640
Location confirmed. Confirmed.

00:33:20.440 --> 00:33:21.680
Evidence Unit, over here.

00:33:29.200 --> 00:33:29.880
Be careful.

00:33:29.880 --> 00:33:30.559
Mind the scene.

00:33:30.920 --> 00:33:31.680
Back to the bureau.

00:33:31.799 --> 00:33:32.839
Lots of trace evidence.

00:33:33.359 --> 00:33:34.279
I'll log these first.

00:33:44.839 --> 00:33:45.839
Got something over here.

00:35:01.920 --> 00:35:02.760
You okay, Jiang?

00:35:02.800 --> 00:35:03.239
I'm fine.

00:35:03.760 --> 00:35:04.360
Don't worry.

00:35:04.719 --> 00:35:05.760
Plenty of us here.

00:35:06.239 --> 00:35:07.079
You'll be fine.

00:35:10.519 --> 00:35:11.159
Captain Wang.

00:35:11.320 --> 00:35:12.320
We found a body.

00:35:12.719 --> 00:35:13.360
Get medical examiner.

00:35:13.400 --> 00:35:13.880
Okay.

00:35:18.480 --> 00:35:19.519
Easy. Easy.

00:35:36.840 --> 00:35:38.599
Put it down here.

00:35:54.760 --> 00:35:57.160
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

00:35:58.159 --> 00:35:58.679
(Chaobei City Museum, Qingjiang)
Chen.

00:35:58.760 --> 00:35:59.760
Can I ask you something?

00:36:00.119 --> 00:36:01.280
These sewers are huge.

00:36:02.039 --> 00:36:03.000
Could

00:36:03.079 --> 00:36:04.280
someone live down here?

00:36:04.639 --> 00:36:06.440
If someone ate and slept down here,

00:36:07.280 --> 00:36:08.679
it's hard to imagine.

00:36:10.519 --> 00:36:12.599
Why would cops come down here?

00:36:13.400 --> 00:36:15.320
Why are you always

00:36:15.840 --> 00:36:16.800
so scared of the police?

00:36:17.039 --> 00:36:17.679
Beaten to death.

00:36:21.599 --> 00:36:23.440
Did something happen before?

00:36:24.320 --> 00:36:25.440
You knew the woman

00:36:26.000 --> 00:36:27.119
in the paper, didn't you?

00:36:47.120 --> 00:36:50.440
♪When a♪

00:36:50.440 --> 00:36:54.400
♪Nameless little flower trembles♪

00:36:54.400 --> 00:36:59.160
♪And lifts its face to the sun♪

00:36:59.160 --> 00:37:04.280
♪In that moment♪

00:37:04.280 --> 00:37:07.320
♪I gaze at♪

00:37:07.320 --> 00:37:11.280
♪Every unfamiliar light♪

00:37:11.280 --> 00:37:15.880
♪Only starlight keeps on shining♪

00:37:15.880 --> 00:37:21.240
♪Warming me♪

00:37:21.240 --> 00:37:23.720
♪Let♪

00:37:23.720 --> 00:37:27.600
♪Every laugh and every tear pass by♪

00:37:27.600 --> 00:37:31.600
♪Then bloom out of the dust♪

00:37:31.600 --> 00:37:38.360
♪Like flowers reaching for the sun♪

00:37:38.360 --> 00:37:40.920
♪Everyone♪

00:37:40.920 --> 00:37:45.360
♪Has walked a winding road♪

00:37:45.360 --> 00:37:48.920
♪It's okay. Every scar♪

00:37:48.920 --> 00:37:55.120
♪Will heal someday♪

00:37:55.120 --> 00:37:58.080
♪When the wind blows♪

00:37:58.080 --> 00:38:02.120
♪Hear me tell what's in my heart♪

00:38:02.120 --> 00:38:06.720
♪Give me a safe, dreamlike♪

00:38:06.720 --> 00:38:11.960
♪Little corner♪

00:38:11.960 --> 00:38:14.880
♪Go chase it♪

00:38:14.880 --> 00:38:19.560
♪Run through the pouring rain♪

00:38:19.560 --> 00:38:23.720
♪Clear skies are up ahead♪

